## Implementation Philosophy

MedSync implementations are designed for speed-to-value while ensuring clinical adoption and sustainable outcomes. Our proven methodology delivers go-live in 12 weeks for standard implementations.

---

## Implementation Timeline

### Standard Implementation (12 weeks)

| Phase | Weeks | Key Activities |
|-------|-------|----------------|
| Discovery & Planning | 1-2 | Requirements, project plan, team setup |
| Configuration | 3-5 | System setup, workflows, integrations |
| Data & Integration | 4-7 | EHR integration, data migration |
| Testing | 7-9 | UAT, performance, security |
| Training | 8-10 | End-user training, super-users |
| Go-Live | 11-12 | Cutover, hypercare, stabilization |

### Enterprise Implementation (16-20 weeks)

| Phase | Weeks | Key Activities |
|-------|-------|----------------|
| Discovery & Planning | 1-3 | Complex requirements, governance |
| Configuration | 4-8 | Multi-facility setup, custom workflows |
| Data & Integration | 6-12 | Multiple EHR integrations |
| Testing | 10-15 | Extensive UAT, pilots |
| Training | 12-17 | Train-the-trainer, role-based |
| Go-Live | 16-20 | Phased rollout, extended hypercare |

